<title>BELGIUM: Belgium, Dutch gold sales OK by Eurostat - source.</title>
<headline>Belgium, Dutch gold sales OK by Eurostat - source.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-02-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Recent gold sales by the Belgian and Dutch central banks have been accepted as legitimate means to cut state debt in a ruling by the European Union's statistics body Eurostat, a Belgian monetary source told Reuters on Monday.</p>
<p>&quot;(Gold sales) cannot count to reducing the deficit but can towards cutting the debt...This was the proposal of the (Belgian) National Bank,&quot; he said.</p>
</text>
